#. placeholders: {sentence_start}, {r}, {u}, {d}, {p}, {t}, {s}, {rep}, {h}
msgid ""
"{sentence_start} and {r} move along the piles, the stock and the "
"foundations. {u} and {d} move within a pile. {p} picks up and places. {t} "
"turns the stock. Backspace undoes. Home and End jump to the first pile and "
"the last foundation. {s} says what you hold and where you are, twice for "
"the count, {rep} reads the table, {h} gives a hint."
msgstr ""
"{sentence_start} und {r} bewegen entlang der Stapel, des Talons und der "
"Ablagen. {u} und {d} bewegen in einem Stapel. {p} nimmt auf und legt ab. "
"{t} dreht am Talon um. Backspace macht rückgängig. Home und End springen "
