"wait until it needs you, then act at once."
msgstr ""
"{p} startet, rührt, wendet, begießt oder holt das Gericht vor dir heraus: "
"warte, bis es dich braucht, dann handle sofort."

#. placeholders: {s}, {r}, {h}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{s} says what needs you now, again for every station, {r} repeats the last "
"call, {h} says what needs you most."
msgstr ""
"{s} sagt, was dich jetzt braucht, nochmal für jede Station, {r} wiederholt "
"die letzte Ansage, {h} sagt, was dich am dringendsten braucht."

#. placeholders: {title}, {rule}, {head}, {keyed}, {left}, {right}, {p}, {up}, {down}, {t}, {s}, {r}, {h}
msgid ""
"{title}.{rule} {head}: {keyed}. {left} and {right} move between them, or "
"press a station's number. {p} starts, stirs, flips, bastes or pulls out the "
"dish in front of you: wait until it needs you, then act at once. {up} "
"describes the dish in front of you, {down} reads the recipe card, {t} says "
"what is happening at that station. {s} says what needs you now, again for "
"every station, {r} repeats the last call, {h} says what needs you most. "
"Escape pauses."
msgstr ""
"{title}.{rule} {head}: {keyed}. {left} und {right} wechseln zwischen ihnen, "
"oder drück die Nummer einer Station. {p} startet, rührt, wendet, begießt "
"oder holt das Gericht vor dir heraus: warte, bis es dich braucht, dann "
"handle sofort. {up} beschreibt das Gericht vor dir, {down} liest die "
"Rezeptkarte, {t} sagt, was an dieser Station passiert. {s} sagt, was dich "
"jetzt braucht, nochmal für jede Station, {r} wiederholt die letzte Ansage, "
"{h} sagt, was dich am dringendsten braucht. Escape pausiert."

#. placeholders: {up}, {down}, {t}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{up} describes the dish in front of you, {down} reads the recipe card, {t} "
"says what is happening at that station."
msgstr ""
"{up} beschreibt das Gericht vor dir, {down} liest die Rezeptkarte, {t} "
"sagt, was an dieser Station passiert."

