"Center lane. {sentence_start} and {right} shift lanes. {sentence_start2} "
"boosts. {sentence_start3} fires the rail gun. {sentence_start4} triggers a "
"slowdown pulse. {sentence_start5} uses priority override. {sentence_start6} "
"speaks lane, hull and stress; press it again for your tools, and again for "
"the sector and the challenge's rule. Escape pauses."
