msgid ""
"Reach dive {DEEP_UNLOCK} in an expedition to begin future expeditions there."
msgstr ""
"Erreiche Tauchgang {DEEP_UNLOCK} in einer Expedition, um künftige "
"Expeditionen dort zu beginnen."

