msgid "Practice pools"
msgstr "Übungstümpel"

msgid ""
"Three sheltered pools with no tide, to learn leaning in and gathering."
msgstr ""
"Drei geschützte Tümpel ohne Flut, um Vorbeugen und Sammeln zu lernen."

#. placeholders: {kinds}, {ALL}
msgid "Your aquarium, {kinds} of {ALL} kinds"
msgstr "Dein Aquarium, {kinds} von {ALL} Arten"

msgid "Visit everything you have gathered."
msgstr "Besuch alles, was du gesammelt hast."

msgid ""
"Your aquarium's tally, your best score at each shore, and your challenge "
"results."
msgstr ""
"Die Bilanz deines Aquariums, dein Bestwert an jeder Küste und deine "
"Herausforderungen."

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Daily, weekly and monthly shores, the same for every player, each with a "
"goal."
msgstr ""
"Tägliche, wöchentliche und monatliche Küsten, gleich für alle, jede mit "
"einem Ziel."

#. placeholders: {resets}
msgid ""
"Daily, weekly and monthly shores, the same for every player, each with a "
"goal. {resets}"
msgstr ""
"Tägliche, wöchentliche und monatliche Küsten, gleich für alle, jede mit "
"einem Ziel. {resets}"

msgid ""
"Up and Down choose a challenge, Enter reads its goal, Escape goes back. "
"Every player gets the same shore: a new daily each day, a weekly each "
"Monday and a monthly event each month."
