#. placeholders: {WEEKLY_SHIFTS}, {WEEKLY_SHIFTS2}, {WEEKLY_STACK}
msgid ""
"Gift Sort shifts {WEEKLY_SHIFTS} to {WEEKLY_SHIFTS2}, then stack "
